{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006a","title":"夏侯惇录功增封","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006a-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"夏侯惇录功增封","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"增封","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":207,"label":"建安十二年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y207","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o006","basis":"建安十二年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006a-q","xiahoucao-q-o006","wuzhu-q-o011","zhuge-q-o005","zhuge-q-b-40accddaa1b32119c6cb"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o006a-q","source_order":[9,18,"O006a"],"order":2112}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0027","name":"夏侯惇","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-q-o011","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f715dc33a31e617fe160","layer":"original","quote":"十二年〖31〗，西征黄祖，虏其人民而还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9b0ef46552fe5fa7e211","layer":"original","quote":"建安十二年，录惇前后功，增封邑千八百户，并前二千五百户。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o006","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9b0ef46552fe5fa7e211","layer":"original","quote":"建安十二年，录惇前后功，增封邑千八百户，并前二千五百户。二十一年，从征孙权。还，使惇都督二十六军〖6〗，留居巢；赐伎乐、名倡，令曰：“魏绛以和戎之功〖7〗，犹受金石之乐〖8〗，况将军乎！”二十四年，太祖军（击破吕布军）于摩陂，召惇常与同载；特见亲重，出入卧内〖9〗。诸将莫得比也。拜前将军，﹝二﹞督诸军还寿春，徙屯召陵。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-40accddaa1b32119c6cb","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-40accddaa1b32119c6cb","layer":"modern","quote":"〖39〗尔来：从那以来。这一句总括上文，所以是从刘备三顾时的建安十二年（公元 207）算起。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1692331886f906f52ea2","start":0,"end":46},{"id":"zhuge-q-o005","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e33c66499df69116b2fc","layer":"original","quote":"由是先主遂诣亮；凡三往，乃见。因屏人曰〖1〗：“汉室倾颓，奸臣窃命〖2〗，主上蒙尘〖3〗。孤不度德量力〖4〗，欲信大义于天下〖5〗；而智术短浅，遂用猖獗〖6〗。至于今日，然志犹未已，君谓计将安出？”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
